Armies slaughter each other to tenth in darkness --- Ravana roars and drives chariot to army end --- Indra orders live capture not killing due boon --- Indra flanks Ravana while Ravana pierces god host --- Meghanada dons granted maya and vanishes --- Meghanada wounds Matali steeds and showers Indra --- Meghanada binds weary Indra and bears him to own host --- Gods assail exhausted Ravana while son halts father --- Ravana praises son and orders Indra borne to city
